<!-- Peasant woman, procedural (Cantiere 2): the same colours of the original (brick-red skirt, blue bodice, apron, ochre headscarf). The
     seed picks how wide the skirt is (straight, bell-shaped, wide down to the ground), whether she has the headscarf or a bun of hair on her head and
     what she carries: a basket of apples at her side, a sack on her back, a jug on her head or nothing. The seed also decides whether she waves with her arm raised. Face, eyes and bodice stay where they are. -->
